        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storefront Door Mortise Deadbolt Trim Plates</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-deadbolt-lock-sets-brass-cylinders-th1101-pb\"><b>Adams Rite MS1850</b></a> style mortise deadbolt including <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\">Global GLO-TH1101 Deadbolt</b></a>.  Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish. Packaged with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere are 3 basic applicable door styles: Radius, Flat, and Bevel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-17000-series-size.gif?v=1704442278\" width=\"375\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Storefront door stiles plate styles\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing the face plate, there are several plate profiles as illustrated below. Flat, Left Hand (L.H.) Bevel, Right Hand (R.H.) Bevel, Radius, and Radius with Weatherstrip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/global-faceplate.jpg?v=1704354498\" width=\"545\" height=\"70\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Storefront face plate styles\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Global TH1100-FP6-10 Mortise Deadbolt Faceplate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Hole: 2-7/8\" x 5/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li>Center of Top Mounting Hole to Top Of Plate: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Bottom Mounting Hole to Bottom Of Plate: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Bottom Mounting Holes : 2\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nBeveled plates are handed.  <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
